WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.685
Bat was sad.

2
00:00:07.686 --> 00:00:13.985
He liked the barn.

3
00:00:13.986 --> 00:00:17.677
He liked Cow and Pig and Cat.

4
00:00:17.678 --> 00:00:22.476
But they did not like Bat.

5
00:00:22.477 --> 00:00:37.918
They did not want to play with him.

6
00:00:37.919 --> 00:00:44.251
"If I am a cow," said Bat, "Cow will play with me.

7
00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:57.487
Cow will be my friend."

8
00:00:57.488 --> 00:01:08.496
"If I am a pig," said Bat, "Pig will play with me.

9
00:01:08.497 --> 00:01:21.194
Pig will be my friend."

10
00:01:21.195 --> 00:01:28.232
"If I am a cat," said Bat, "Cat will play with me.

11
00:01:28.233 --> 00:01:40.825
Cat will be my friend."

12
00:01:40.826 --> 00:01:44.619
"I will think and think," said Bat.

13
00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:56.805
"I will think of a way to be a pig, a cow, or a cat.

14
00:01:56.806 --> 00:02:01.890
And soon I will have new friends!"

